    "title": "How many points did Cooper Flagg score in NBA debut? Spurs vs. Mavericks stats - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James H. Williams ,\n4 minutes ago\nTop pick Cooper Flagg largely struggled and the Dallas Mavericks had no answer for 2023 No. 1 pick Victor Wembanyama as the San Antonio Spurs rolled to a 125-92 win in Dallas in the season opener for both teams.\nFlagg had a slow start in his NBA debut, going scoreless in the first half after missing his first two shots. He would score his first career points with 11:42 left in the third quarter.\nThe rookie struggled to find his stride in the second half but did put together a double-double performance with 10 points and 10 rebounds.\nCooper Flagg stats vs. Spurs Points: 10 FG: 4-for-13 (0-for-1 from 3) Free Throws : 2-for-2 Rebounds: 10 Assists: 0 Steals: 1 Blocks: 0 Turnovers: 3 Fouls: 3 Minutes: 32 This article originally appeared on USA TODAY: How many points did Cooper Flagg score in NBA debut? Spurs vs. Mavericks stats",
